      <link>//localhost:1313/post/%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>2267593025@qq.com (the_last_kid)</author>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/post/%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>动态规划专题</h1><p>作者：the_last_kid（2267593025@qq.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="动态规划">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%8a%a8%e6%80%81%e8%a7%84%e5%88%92"></a>
动态规划
</h1><h2 id="条件转移方程">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%9d%a1%e4%bb%b6%e8%bd%ac%e7%a7%bb%e6%96%b9%e7%a8%8b"></a>
条件转移方程
</h2><ul>
<li>为什么状态转移方程有时候不一样</li>
</ul>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>对比维度</th>
          <th>当前代码的逻辑（<code>memo[i]</code>对应<code>a[0]~a[i]</code>）</th>
          <th>你提到的转移方程逻辑（<code>memo[i]</code>对应<code>sum[0]~sum[i-1]</code>）</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td><code>memo[i]</code>定义</td>
          <td>前<code>i+1</code>个元素（<code>a[0]~a[i]</code>）的最大收益</td>
          <td>前<code>i</code>个元素（<code>sum[0]~sum[i-1]</code>）的最大收益</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>转移方程</td>
          <td><code>max(dfs(i-1), dfs(i-2)+a[i])</code></td>
          <td><code>max(dfs(i-1), dfs(i-2)+sum[i-1])</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>对应<code>a</code>/<code>sum</code>的元素</td>
          <td>选<code>a[i]</code>时加<code>a[i]</code></td>
          <td>选<code>sum[i-1]</code>时加<code>sum[i-1]</code></td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<ul>
<li>
<p>值域打家劫舍https://leetcode.cn/problems/maximum-total-damage-with-spell-casting/solutions/2812389/tao-lu-da-jia-jie-she-pythonjavacgo-by-e-p9b5/</p>
        
